#Data I used - 2020 to 2024 Subway OTP from MTA Open Data
#Data Columns - Month (formatted like 20200101), Line (1234567ACEBDFMNRQWGL), Day Type (1 for weekday, 2 for weekend), Number of scheduled arrivals, number of actual arrivals, OTP)
#MTA website defines OTP as the amount of lines that arrive at final stop within 5 minutes and 59 seconds of scheduled time.
